<!-- Boat-mode button while the mode is off (outline, matching ic_sailboat_filled_24's own
     doc comment for the on/off pairing this replaces: ic_schedule_24/ic_schedule_filled_24,
     asked for explicitly, since a boat reads more directly as "boat mode" than a clock ever
     did). fillColor is only a placeholder: iconButton() applies the tint at runtime, like the
     other icons; the paths themselves are stroke outlines (fillColor transparent), not filled
     shapes, matching this glyph's own outline/filled pairing rather than the single-fill style
     most other icons in this app use. -->
